; The kernel32 entry points the loader imports. llvm-dlltool turns this
; into the import library lld-link needs.
LIBRARY KERNEL32.dll
EXPORTS
CloseHandle
CreateFileW
ExitProcess
FlushInstructionCache
GetCommandLineW
GetCurrentProcess
GetFileSizeEx
GetProcAddress
GetStdHandle
LoadLibraryA
ReadFile
VirtualAlloc
VirtualProtect
WriteFile
